# The preflight script's cosign bundle is produced by the Pages deploy workflow at publish
# time (keyless, Fulcio/Rekor) and belongs to the published site, never to the tree. The
# SHA-256 sidecar next to it IS committed — it is generated by `make preflight-table` and
# held to the tree by `make preflight-table-verify`.
public/preflight.sh.cosign.bundle
